  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">500 arbetsl&#xf6;sa nyutexaminerade akademiker fr&#xe5;n fattiga familjer f&#xe5;r tillf&#xe4;lligt arbete. M&#xe5;lgruppen &#xe4;r b&#xe5;de m&#xe4;n och kvinnor. Huvudm&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r insatsen &#xe4;r att minska risk f&#xf6;r matbrist i utvalda familjer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to support a Cash-for-Work program for 500  unemployed young graduates that come from poor families targeting both males and females. The ultimate aim is a reduction in the vulnerability of food security in the targeted households.</narrative>
  </description>
